# GeoDB Cities (RapidAPI) key for city autocomplete. OPTIONAL.
# WARNING: VITE_* variables are bundled into the public JS. Treat this key as
# public: restrict it by domain and set a quota in the RapidAPI dashboard.
# If left empty (or if GeoDB fails/rate-limits), search uses the keyless Open-Meteo geocoding API.
VITE_GEODB_API_KEY=

# Vercel Web Analytics switch. OPTIONAL. Not a secret (it is just "on" or "off").
# Leave unset: analytics then runs only for a Vercel *production* build (VERCEL_ENV=production) and never for
# previews, local builds or tests. Set "on" for the Production environment only if Vercel does not expose
# system environment variables to your builds; "off" disables it everywhere.
VITE_ANALYTICS=
